    },
    "datePublished": "2026-08-27T21:51:26+03:00",
    "dateModified": "2026-08-27T21:51:26+03:00",
    "description": "YEN\u0130 Parti Kayseri te\u015fkilat\u0131nda 230 \u00fcyelik kayd\u0131n parti sistemine i\u015flenmedi\u011fi iddias\u0131 tart\u0131\u015fma yaratt\u0131. Kocasinan Kurucu \u0130l\u00e7e Ba\u015fkan\u0131 Emre Ayan, sosyal medya hesab\u0131ndan yapt\u0131\u011f\u0131 payla\u015f\u0131mla parti y\u00f6netimine tepki g\u00f6sterirken, s\u00f6z konusu payla\u015f\u0131m\u0131n yakla\u015f\u0131k 10 dakika sonra silindi\u011fi belirtildi.",
    "articleBody": "Kayseri\u2019de YEN\u0130 Parti te\u015fkilat\u0131nda \u00fcyelik kay\u0131tlar\u0131 \u00fczerinden dikkat \u00e7eken bir tart\u0131\u015fma g\u00fcndeme geldi. Kocasinan Kurucu \u0130l\u00e7e Ba\u015fkan\u0131 Emre Ayan, partiye kazand\u0131r\u0131ld\u0131\u011f\u0131 belirtilen 230 ki\u015finin \u00fcyelik kay\u0131tlar\u0131n\u0131n sisteme i\u015flenmedi\u011fini \u00f6ne s\u00fcrd\u00fc.\r\n\r\nAyan\u2019dan parti y\u00f6netimine tepki\r\n\r\nSosyal medya hesab\u0131ndan konuya ili\u015fkin payla\u015f\u0131m yapan Ayan, \u00fcyelik kay\u0131tlar\u0131n\u0131n sisteme girilmedi\u011fi iddias\u0131 \u00fczerinden parti y\u00f6netimine y\u00f6nelik sert ifadeler kulland\u0131.\r\n\r\nAyan\u2019\u0131n a\u00e7\u0131klamas\u0131 parti te\u015fkilat\u0131ndaki \u00fcyelik s\u00fcrecine ili\u015fkin tart\u0131\u015fmalar\u0131 beraberinde getirirken, payla\u015f\u0131m\u0131n yay\u0131mland\u0131ktan yakla\u015f\u0131k 10 dakika sonra kald\u0131r\u0131lmas\u0131 da dikkat \u00e7ekti.\r\n\r\nPayla\u015f\u0131m k\u0131sa s\u00fcre sonra silindi\r\n\r\nAyan\u2019\u0131n payla\u015f\u0131m\u0131n\u0131 neden kald\u0131rd\u0131\u011f\u0131na ili\u015fkin herhangi bir a\u00e7\u0131klama yap\u0131l\u0131p yap\u0131lmad\u0131\u011f\u0131 bilinmezken, 230 \u00fcyelik kayd\u0131n durumuna ili\u015fkin parti y\u00f6netiminden de hen\u00fcz kamuoyuna yans\u0131yan bir a\u00e7\u0131klama bulunmuyor.\r\n\r\n\u0130ddialar\u0131n ard\u0131ndan g\u00f6zler YEN\u0130 Parti Kayseri te\u015fkilat\u0131ndan gelecek a\u00e7\u0131klamaya \u00e7evrildi.",
    "wordCount": 114,
    "genre": "news",
    "isFamilyFriendly": true,
    "publishingPrinciples": "https://www.durusthaber.com/gizlilik-ilkeleri",
